Taking Brian's idea and incorporating some of Hadley's (and others')
suggestions I came up with this.

I didn't make it in R but it probably could be done. Blues were a
rather arbitrary choice, loosely based on the RColorBrewer Blues
palette.

Another idea for a small format version (i.e. a favicon) would be just
to use one square of the 2x2 grid, rather than trying to shrink the
whole thing down.

Charlotte

